# mando_le 1.44 - worked out by the app from the ports of TMNT Pro 1.58.
# Emulator-proven 2026-09-24 by a full build check (modes/gamecheck.sh play full, item 162): the
# runtime hooked the game, 38 of its 40 shots came from their switches, a drain ended each ball, and
# the 7 events below fired where their names say (a tilted ball, three balls to the game's end).
# Shots no press made (their switch is left out of the check, or needs two): Left outlane, Right outlane.
# program sha1 1027924b12c1673e5d8f7e1b3df00485c2b5fc1f, portgen revision 3, 1 reference port(s) of framework generation A.
# Callouts heard in the emulator 2026-09-24 (item 163): countdown, ten_seconds.

game           mando_le
version        1.44

